-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
ATTRIBUTION TO ORIGINAL TUTORIAL AUTHOR
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project was developed as part of a university assignment based on the
educational concepts taught in the tutorial:

  "Dogs, JavaScript & An API 🐶 Fetch, Promises & Async Await"
  by Brad Schiff (LearnWebCode)
  https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AVmGmLFcukM

Brad Schiff is the original author of the tutorial and its associated
teaching material. This project implements the same educational concepts
(Fetch API, Promises, async/await, JSON handling, dynamic DOM updates) as
a course assignment, using original code written for that purpose. It is
NOT a redistribution of Brad Schiff's own source files, and it is NOT
presented as, or claimed to be, Brad Schiff's original work.

